'''Flora''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the [[Flora Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Bloom Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Easter Event 2025|2025 Easter Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The gun has a white-pink gradient on the body and has vines growing around it, the handle has a green and pink pattern and has a flower at the bottom.

== Trivia ==
* It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Bloom]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Bloom Set|Bloom Set]].

